    <!-- Privacy & about -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Plan-B is local-first.\n\n• Your tasks, notes, projects, habits, goals, events and focus sessions are stored only on this device.\n• The app has no account, no servers, no analytics, no ads and no tracking. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you turn on the optional AI assistant with your own provider key; then only the text you choose to send goes directly to the provider you chose. Your key is stored encrypted on this device and is never backed up.\n• Voice input uses the speech service on your phone; Plan-B keeps no audio, only the recognized text.\n• Plan-B Pro is bought through the Cafe Bazaar app. Payment happens in Cafe Bazaar; your notes and plans are never shared with it.\n• Backups and exports are written only to files you choose. You decide where they go.\n• Reminders are shown by this device. On the lock screen they show a generic message unless you allow private content in Android settings.\n• Android cloud backup is disabled for app data so your plans are never copied automatically.\n\nYou can delete all data at any time from Settings › Backup &amp; data.</string>
    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_body">Plan-B is a personal planner and notebook: daily, weekly and monthly planning, calendar, tasks, projects, notes, habits, goals and focus — in Persian and English, with Jalali and Gregorian calendars.</string>
